      "container": "container",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "petronio",
      "portrait": {
        "class": "char_img_petronio",
        "asset": "petronio_dubbioso.png"
      },
      "text": "You know, your help could be crucial. We would love to create a new university system with more freedom and fewer rules... We have already thought of everything.",
