      "id": "23",
      "container": "container",
      "kind": "line",
      "speaker": "gabriele",
      "portrait": {
        "class": "char_img_gabriele",
        "asset": "gabriele.png"
      },
      "text": "When the reform took place it seemed to suit everyone inside the fucking system, and as far as I was concerned those weren't my fucking problems anyway. But now that you want to change things, why should I keep quiet? Now you know everything there is to know.",
      "next": [
        {
          "to": "24"
        }
      ]
